    "homepage": {
      "status": 200,
      "body": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"zh-Hant\" data-dpr=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 80px;\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"icon.png\"><title>AJCLOUD</title><script async=\"\" src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-YLQ7R2FPGR\"></script><script>window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || []\n      function gtag() {\n        dataLayer.push(arguments)\n      }\n      gtag('js', new Date())\n      gtag('config', 'G-YLQ7R2FPGR')</script><link href=\"/css/chunk-10078b83.92ca92b2.css\" rel=\"prefetch\"><link href=\"/js/chunk-10078b83.8e6f89d8.js\" rel=\"prefetch\"><link href=\"/css/app.68e2f9b6.css\" rel=\"preload\" as=\"style\"><link href=\"/js/app.4c151796.js\" rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\"><link href=\"/js/chunk-vendors.b12583fe.js\" rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\"><link href=\"/css/app.68e2f9b6.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/css/chunk-10078b83.92ca92b2.css\"><script charset=\"utf-8\" src=\"/js/chunk-10078b83.8e6f89d8.js\"></script></head><body style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><div id=\"app\"><div class=\"home\"><div class=\"navbar\"><img src=\"/img/logo.2f03fa49.png\" alt=\"ajcloud\" class=\"logo\"><span class=\"nav_home\" style=\"color: rgb(119, 191, 80);\">首頁</span><span class=\"nav_products\">產品簡介</span><span class=\"nav_tools\">應用下載</span><span class=\"nav_partners\">合作夥伴</span><span class=\"nav_contact\">聯繫我們</span><div class=\"lang\"><span class=\"en\" style=\"font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.7;\">英文</span><span> / </span><span class=\"zh\" style=\"font-weight: 700; opacity: 1;\">繁體中文</span></div></div><div class=\"main\"><img id=\"banner\" src=\"/img/banner.3d264dad.png\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"bgc\"></div><div class=\"home_box\"><h2 class=\"home_name\">Smart Your Home</h2><p class=\"home_text\"> AJCLOUD成立於2018年，是一家致力於 </p><p class=\"home_text\"> 為智能家居產品品牌提供網絡化、智能化服務的全球性公司。 </p></div></div><div class=\"introduction\"><img src=\"/img/pic_4.5a1cd405.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"pic4\"><div class=\"intro_box\"><img src=\"/img/introduction.d986258f.png\" alt=\"ajcloud\" class=\"intro_pic\"><p class=\"intro_text\"> AJCLOUD是一個可直接使用的應用，同時也是一個以IP攝像機解決方案為主的智能家居雲平台系統。它可以為硬件方案商提供產品整體解決方案和增值業務服務。 </p></div></div><div id=\"products\"><div class=\"pro_heart\"><div class=\"pro_top\"><h2 class=\"pro_tittle\">IP攝像機解決方案</h2><div class=\"pro_line\"></div><p class=\"pro_text\"> 我們提供IP攝像機的整體解決方案，包括室內攝像機、室外攝像機、雲台攝像機、卡片攝像機、庭院燈攝像機、電池攝像機、可視門鈴等。面向接入AJCloud平台的合作夥伴，我們可以提供成品、模組、SDK集成等多種方式。 </p><ul class=\"pro_ul\"><li><img src=\"/img/camera_2.bce50ab2.png\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"pro_name\">網絡攝像機</span></li><li><img src=\"/img/camera_4.00298932.png\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"pro_name\">電池攝像機</span></li><li><img src=\"/img/light.a62df673.png\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"pro_name\">燈泡攝像機</span></li><li><img src=\"/img/camera_5.fd688eaf.png\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"pro_name\">可視門鈴</span></li><li class=\"last\"><img src=\"/img/feed.265b39ce.png\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"pro_name\">寵物餵食器</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"pro_bottom\"><div class=\"pro_right\"><h2 class=\"pro_right_tittle\">增值業務服務</h2><div class=\"pro_right_line\"></div><p class=\"pro_right_text\"> 我們還將持續為終端用戶提供增值業務服務，如升級保護計劃、開通雲存儲等。用戶可以通過PayPal或信用卡訂閱來享受專業的保護服務。 </p></div></div><img src=\"/img/pic_1.ca5dbd59.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"pic_1\"><img src=\"/img/pic_2.a48a93ca.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"pic_2\"><img src=\"/img/pic_3.cbd41b1c.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"pic_3\"></div></div><div id=\"tools\"><div class=\"tool_heart\"><br style=\"clear: both;\"><h2 class=\"tool_tittle\">應用下載</h2><div class=\"tool_line\"></div><p class=\"tool_text\"> AJCloud應用程序提供了非常豐富的功能和極好的用戶體驗，可以通過移動端和桌面端接入使用。我們建議使用移動端應用，它可以完全展示所有的功能。 </p><div class=\"android\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" class=\"tool_pic\"><span class=\"tool_system\">Android</span><!----><img src=\"/img/yingyongbao.b8d4ce18.png\" class=\"QRcode\"></div><div class=\"ios\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" class=\"tool_pic\"><span class=\"tool_system\">IOS</span><!----><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" class=\"QRcode\"></div><div class=\"windows\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" class=\"tool_pic\"><span class=\"tool_system\">Windows</span></div><div class=\"mac\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" class=\"tool_pic\"><span class=\"tool_system\">Mac</span></div></div></div><div id=\"partners\"><div class=\"par_heart\"><div class=\"par_right\"><h2 class=\"par_tittle\">遍布世界各地</h2><div class=\"par_line\"></div><p class=\"par_text\"> 我們的合作夥伴、客戶和終端用戶遍布全球，很多客戶的產品已經在相關領域獲得了非常不錯的銷量和評價。 </p></div><img src=\"/img/pic_5.a802c53b.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"par_pic\"><ul class=\"par_ul\"><li><a href=\"https://www.wansview.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/img/wvc.b5edd65d.png\" alt=\"wansview\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.faleemi.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/img/fam.d38807c2.png\" alt=\"faleemi\"></a></li><li><img src=\"/img/hug.39e04b69.png\" alt=\"homeguard\"></li><li class=\"last\"><img src=\"/img/phl.567aa366.png\" alt=\"philips\"></li><li><img src=\"/img/tsc.77aaab00.png\" alt=\"tscloud\"></li><li><img src=\"/img/wcn.90c4acdb.png\" alt=\"网视无忧\"></li><li><img src=\"/img/nex.dce823b4.png\" alt=\"Nexus Link\"></li><li class=\"last\"><img src=\"/img/kmv.a025be79.png\" alt=\"Kamoviz\"></li></ul></div></div><div id=\"contact\"><img src=\"/img/bgc_footer.9b4fef86.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"con_bgc\"><div class=\"con_mask\"></div><div class=\"con_heart\"><div class=\"con_box1\"><h3>公司地址</h3><h5>美國 :</h5><p>5 BREWSTER STREET,</p><p>#2039 GLEN COVE, NY 11542</p><h5>香港 ：</h5><p>FLAT/RM 1303, 13/F, CHEONG TAI BUILDING,</p><p>NO.287-289 RECLAMATION STREET, KL</p></div><div class=\"con_box2\"><h3>聯繫我們</h3><h5>郵箱:</h5><p>service@ajcloud.net</p></div><div class=\"con_line\"></div><p class=\"copy\"><span>© 2018-2026 南京安居雲信息技術有限公司 保留所有權利</span><a href=\"https://beian.miit.gov.cn/\" target=\"_blank\">苏ICP备18037759号-2</a></p></div></div></div></div><script src=\"/js/chunk-vendors.b12583fe.js\"></script><script src=\"/js/app.4c151796.js\"></script></body></html>",
